From 361c83fe0181ad85e18ac3b821599b4ef41aef6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kostiantyn Andriiuk <konstantin@andriyuk.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 13:53:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 42/42] leds: vince: expose stock front torch through LED class

Replace the one-shot diagnostic with normal repeatable torch on/off. Keep the stock ten-pulse mode and PM/shutdown off; no calibrated current or hardware timeout claim. Integrate the already-tested native FM driver into full kernel builds so the cumulative feature candidate retains it.

Signed-off-by: Kostiantyn Andriiuk <konstantin@andriyuk.com>
